<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $60-1/2(FIM 309.40).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $60-1/2(FIM 309.40).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $1-1/4 at $60-1/2 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 309.40 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed 10.60 markka higher at 307.60 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended down $0-1/8 at $36-3/8 in New York on Tuesday. The price per share equals about 93.00 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 1.20 markka at 91.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded on Wall Street. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Rauma closed down 2.00 markka at 112.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
